# Dam+ shots at the stock walls redrawn around our doorways (tests/damplus/shots.sh). Plan language: modding/bot.md.
# Each target: a scripted warp (tests only) to a spot in front of the wall, then the bot aims at a point of the redrawn wall
# piece (`face`, pitch included) and fires four single shots (`press z`: the Z trigger on player 1's pad). GE_DUMP_BOND=1 logs
# where each bullet meets the bg ("bghit: ... world=") or that it met none ("bgmiss"). World coordinates from the seams the log
# prints (file units / 0.23364) and the wing frames (port_damplus_wings.c); keep them in step with shots.sh.
#  A, B: the valley yard's west wall (room 111), 300 either side of the comms doorway, from 250 out in the yard
#  C, D: room 84's west wall, the slivers either side of the gallery hatch (18 wide), from 150 in the room
#  E, F: room 91's south wall, 100 west and 30 east of the spillway doorway (100 east, a stock pillar stands in front of the wall), from 200 in the chamber
#  G, H: the downstream face (room 64's big face triangle, redrawn in room 145 around the passage), from the balcony
name dpshots
peace 1
wait 90
warp 16166 -107 10844
face 15967 13 10692
press z 2
wait 12
press z 2
wait 12
press z 2
wait 12
press z 2
wait 30
